{"ref":"BDB, גְּבִירָה","hw":"גְּבִירָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבִירָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> lady, queen</strong>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.19\">1 K 11:19</a>;<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> queen-mother</strong>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.13\">1 K 15:13</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.16\">2 Ch 15:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְסִרֶהָ מִגּ׳</span> <em>he removed her from</em> (the position of) <em>queenmother;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.13\">2 K 10:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.18\">Je 13:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.2\">29:2</a>.","next":"BDB, גְּבֶ֫רֶת","prev":"BDB, גְּבִיר"}